              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lomhlangano omkhulu lebandla lamazibulo alotshiweyo ezulwini, lakuNkulunkulu uMahluleli wabo bonke, lemimoya yabalungileyo abapheleliswayo,",
