        },
        {
          "text": "ozwi lakhe ngalesosikhathi lazamazamisa umhlaba, kodwa khathesi uthembisile, esithi: Ngisezakuba kanye futhi, kungeyisikho umhlaba wodwa, kodwa lezulu.",
          "type": "text",
