        },
        {
          "text": "Lelilizwi elithi: Kusezakuba kanye, litshengisa ukususwa kwezinto ezinyakaziswayo, njengokuthi okwenziwayo, ukuze kuhlale okunganyikinywayo.",
          "type": "text",
